{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_014A80","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"人的心脏停了，也不会立刻死亡。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"因为心脏只是负责把血液送往全身。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"但心脏一停，氧气就无法输送到大脑，不久就会死亡。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"所以这时候就要做心脏按摩。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"AUX_CPR_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"就算心脏停了，只要在脑细胞死亡前进行心脏按摩，就能把人救回来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"AUX_CPR_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"在CO-OPS中，LIFE槽归零就表示进入濒死状态。到了这一步，应该已经无法行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"对濒死的同伴进行心脏按摩，就能让他重返战线。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":"AUX_CPR_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"当然，战斗中做心脏按摩很危险。那段时间你自己也会暴露在危险中。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"话虽如此，CO-OPS的同伴是一心同体。别想着把谁一个人丢下不管。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"当然，这一点是相互的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"如果作战中你和所有同伴都死了，就再也没人能救你们了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"所以到了这里，就是<R=结束,游戏结束>了。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=结束,游戏结束>","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"}]}